AI DETECTION PROJECT STATUS
===========================

PROJECT OVERVIEW
----------------
This project is a multimodal AI-driven deepfake and misinformation detection system designed to analyze text, image/video, audio, document, and spoofing inputs. The application combines a Python FastAPI backend with a polished React + Vite frontend and has been prepared for reviewer presentation, demonstration, and technical validation.

