IMPLEMENTED MODULES
--------------------
1. Image/Video Deepfake Detection
   - File: backend/modules/image_video/detector.py
   - Modes: Xception / ResNet18
   - Endpoint: POST /api/detect
   - Uses trained weights when available; otherwise safe demo fallback.

2. Hybrid AI Text Detection
   - File: backend/modules/text/detector.py
   - Model direction: DeBERTa-based hybrid text classification pipeline
   - Input: pasted text or UTF-8 .txt upload
   - Endpoint: POST /api/analyze with modality=text
   - Supports model-path overrides through environment configuration.

3. Audio Deepfake Detection
   - File: backend/modules/audio/detector.py
   - Model direction: Wav2Vec2-based audio forensic pipeline
   - Input: .wav or .mp3 upload
   - Endpoint: POST /api/analyze with modality=audio

4. Document Forgery Detection
   - File: backend/modules/document/detector.py
   - Endpoint: POST /api/detect-document
   - Current behavior: functional fallback structure for demo/testing until production model weights are added.

5. Spoofing / Liveness Integration
   - Supported via /api/analyze with modality=spoof
   - Project architecture is ready for live presentation-attack detection models.

API ROUTES
----------
GET  /                     Backend status
GET  /health               Health check
POST /api/detect           Image/video detection
POST /api/analyze          Text, image, video, audio, and spoofing analysis
POST /api/detect-document  Document forgery analysis

